      "Time-critical goals: a goal carrying a deadline is refused at claim time when the unit can't physically reach it in time — the planner declines up front instead of accepting a mission it will miss",
      "Native safety layer below the mission: battery and geofence return-to-home, altitude bands plus a predicted-closest-approach guard between aircraft, and planned radio silence per unit",
      "Ground-control role runs the identical firmware image and exposes a separate operator link — swarm management software never touches the mesh wire format",
