      "A mission workspace beside the map: open a Loom plan, preview it over a zone, rehearse it in a dry run played out on the same map, then launch it, approve its gated steps and follow it live — or cancel it",
      "Runs entirely off the mesh's own shared state — no internet, no cloud backend, nothing to stand up beyond the GC-SPU itself",
